# Portable JDK 21 + Maven fetched to build the sidecar. Downloaded, never
# vendored: ~250 MB of third-party binaries do not belong in git history.
tools/toolchain/
# Harness and packaging output. `provider-e2e.mjs --json` writes wherever you
# point it, `build-runtime.mjs` assembles ~90 MB into sidecar/dist (already
# covered by the `dist` rule above), and the sidecar writes a scratch data dir
# when run directly rather than through Electron.
e2e-*.json
e2e-*.log
sidecar/plugin-data/
